            "review_title": "Review at Veggie Saigon Da Nang",
            "review_text": "Lotus\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nDELICIOUS CHEAP VEGETARIAN RESTAURANT IN DA NANG\nFeb 2024 • Business\nI ate at this restaurant in Saigon and had the opportunity to travel to Da Nang so I wanted to try it. It's true that it's still the same flavor, the space is cozy, there are tables for families, I like the vegan dishes here because of the ingredients and perfect combination. The dish is moderately seasoned, low in fat, and low in colorants/flavors. A vegetarian restaurant worth trying\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten March 24, 2024",
